// TLS-degrade seam (PC-L-1): renewal give-up / parse failures report here so
// the health plane (when wired) marks the instance DEGRADED instead of the
// service silently running to certificate expiry. Unconditional so it compiles
// with or without a health reporter; reasons are replayed to late subscribers.
struct TlsDegradeSeam {
